        en: { name: 'Caburní waterfall in Topes de Collantes', description: 'A 60-metre waterfall in the cool Escambray Mountains, reached by a trail through coffee plantations and rainforest. Below it is a natural pool for swimming.', tip: 'Take a taxi or jeep from Trinidad, about 40 minutes of hairpin bends, and start the trail in the morning, as the climb back is steep.' },
